SUMMARY:Environmental Action Team (EAT) Meeting
DESCRIPTION:This is a virtual meeting! · The Environmental Action Team (EAT) is an action-oriented group of folx that are dedicated to bringing information and education about our climate crisis to UU Avl and the community. We welcome everyone to join us and help make our small spot on this earth a little better. For more information or a link to the Zoom meeting\, contact Venny Zachritz or Kate Jerome.
